OL,3,GNEWSAMan who posed as medical student
OL,4,Aat hospital sentenced to community
OL,5,Aservice
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who posed as a medical student to
OL,8,Fgain access to hospital wards and
OL,9,Fpatient files has been ordered to carry
OL,10,Fout community service.
OL,12,FStephen Simpson previously admitted
OL,13,Fcarrying out the fraud at Aberdeen
OL,14,FRoyal Infirmary (ARI) between 9
OL,15,FDecember 2023 and 26 January 2024.
OL,17,FThe 22-year-old accessed the hospital
OL,18,Fwhile wearing medical scrubs, NHS
OL,19,Fbranded clothing, a stethoscope and a
OL,20,Fpager.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
